<title>USA: BRT Realty cuts stake in Tappan Zee.</title>
<headline>BRT Realty cuts stake in Tappan Zee.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRT Realty Trust said on Tuesday it reduced its stake in Tappan Zee Financial Inc to 4.95 percent or 76,950 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, BRT, of Great Neck, N.Y., said it sold 5,150 shares of Tappan Zee on September 18 and 19 at $12.25 a share.</p>
</text>
